Symptom	What to check first
503     Service Unavailable	Are there usable targets in the target group? Check listener actions and target health.
502     Bad Gateway	Check target connectivity, application responses, protocol/port mismatch, and connection resets.
504 Gateway Timeout	Check whether the target responds within the ALB timeout and whether the application or dependencies are slow.
Target is unhealthy	Health-check path, expected status code, Nginx status, security-group rules, and routing.
DNS name doesn't open	ALB state, DNS name, scheme, public subnets, IGW route, listener, and client network.
Only one server appears	Confirm both targets are healthy and registered; account for connection reuse and the configured routing algorithm.
HTTPS certificate error	Certificate domain coverage, ACM Region, certificate status, and listener certificate selection.
